# The FM voice (EN_FM, the SMK-37 build): its pages after Tempo (HOME again), the keys playing it on every page
# (SEL + ENV on its page), velocity, Snap, mono, MIDI channel 2, the pad singing a DX7 patch, a DX7 bank in
# over SysEx (U01..U32), stored and back after a power cycle. Needs build/syx/bankD.syx and bad.syx
# (tools/dx7_bank.py; tests/run_tests.sh makes them)
wait 500
expect playing 1
expect pool 0x5AD
# HOME again: the FM page (Level, Patch, Bright, Space), then FM keys
tap HOME
expect view 1
expect par99 0
wait 200
shot fm_page.png
padsfile fm_page.pads
# the keys are the scale's until SEL + ENV (SCALE + CHORD) on its page
tapkey 1
expect pool 0x7AD
tapkey 1
expect pool 0x5AD
press SEL
tap ENV
release SEL
expect par107 1
# now a key plays it, and leaves the scale alone; on any page
tap LFO
keyvel 110
wav fm_keys.wav
key w4 down
wait 400
expect pool 0x5AD
expect fmlevel >3
expect lastfm 0x913C6E
key w4 up
wait 300
key w2 down
key w4 down
key w6 down
wait 1200
shot fm_chord.png
key w2 up
key w4 up
key w6 up
wait 1500
# another patch: PATCH turned to A03 SYN LEAD 1 (K2 on the FM page)
tap HOME
tap HOME
expect view 1
spin K2 2
expect par99 2
key w5 down
wait 600
key w5 up
wait 800
# FM keys page: Snap to the scale: F#3 (not in A Aeolian) sounds F3
tap HOME
expect view 2
spin K1 1
expect par102 1
keyvel 100
key b0 down
wait 100
expect lastfm 0x913564
key b0 up
wait 100
expect lastfm 0x813500
# mono with glide: a legato line
spin K2 1
expect par103 1
spin K3 40
key w0 down
wait 300
key w4 down
wait 300
key w0 up
wait 300
key w4 up
wait 600
spin K2 -1
spin K1 -1
wavstop
# MIDI channel 2 plays it too
midi 91 48 64
wait 300
expect fmlevel >3
midi 81 48 00
wait 1500
# the pad singing a DX7 patch: Sound past the sixteen (C03 STRING 1: patch 66, Sound 82)
tap ENV
spin K3 81
expect par10 82
wav pad_dx7.wav
wait 6000
expect pad_level >5
shot pad_dx7.png
wavstop
spin K3 -81
# a DX7 bank over SysEx: U01..U32, stored at once (the music pauses a moment for the write)
sysex build/syx/bad.syx
wait 300
expect store_writes 0
sysex build/syx/bankD.syx
wait 1500
expect store_writes >0
tap HOME
tap HOME
spin K2 128
expect par99 130
wait 200
shot fm_user.png
key w4 down
wait 500
expect fmlevel >2
key w4 up
wait 500
# a power cycle: the bank is back from flash
reboot
wait 800
tap HOME
spin K2 130
expect par99 130
press SEL
tap ENV
release SEL
key w4 down
wait 500
expect fmlevel >2
key w4 up
